@startuml C3_Create_Vessel_Visit_Execution_Process_View
title C3 – Create Vessel Visit Execution (Process View / System Sequence Diagram)
hide footbox

actor "Logistics Operator" as LogisticsOp
participant "VVEController\n(API Layer)" as Controller
participant "VVEService\n(Lógica de Negócio)" as Service
participant "VVEMapper\n(Conversão DTO ↔ Entidade)" as Mapper
participant "PortContext\n(Entity Framework Core)" as Context
database "Database System\n(SQL / InMemory)" as DB


LogisticsOp -> Controller : POST /api/VesselVisitExecutions (CreateVVEDTO)
Controller -> Mapper : Converte DTO para Entidade VesselVisitExecution
Mapper --> Controller : Retorna Entidade VesselVisitExecution
Controller -> Service : ValidateVVN(vvnId)
Service -> Context : Verifica existência de VVN
Context -> DB : SELECT VesselVisitNotifications WHERE Id = vvnId
DB --> Context : VVN encontrado
Context --> Service : VVN válido
Service -> Service : GenerateVVEIdentifier()\nDefine ActualArrivalTime\nDefine CreatorUserId\nMarca Status = "In Progress"
Service --> Controller : VVE preparado
Controller -> Context : Adiciona VesselVisitExecution e chama SaveChanges()
Context -> DB : INSERT INTO VesselVisitExecutions (...)
DB --> Context : Confirma inserção
Controller --> LogisticsOp : HTTP 201 Created (VVEDTO com status "In Progress")

@enduml
